{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 15, :comments ["<b>ולא תבא</b> Three times in the Masorah: ולא תבא דמעתך · ולא תבא עלינו רעה · ולא תבא עליו השמש. So that ולא תבא דמעתך — lest your tear come, i.e., lest he weep over you because he has nothing to eat. ולא תבא עלינו רעה — lest evil come upon us, for if not, he will call upon HaShem against you and evil will come upon you." "<b> והיה בך חטא</b> Adjacent to it: לא יומתו אבות על בנים ובנים לא יומתו על אבות. To teach that sometimes through your sin your children die (i.e., when they hold the deeds of their fathers in their hands, and ערש\"י)." "<b> בחטאו יומתו לא תטה</b> To teach: whoever perverts judgment is liable to death."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:10:35.639097456Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}